; The IWsaNotifications service that Microsoft's SystemApp registers last during initialization
; (on Microsoft's image SystemUIApp looks it up). Rules are verbatim from the reference system_ext_sepolicy.cil.
; Without the type addService gets "SELinux denied", the exception aborts SystemApp initialization:
; waitForNetworkReady/notifyInitialized are never run, while the geocoder's waitForInitialized and the heartbeat
; of the Lifetime channel hang forever (host logcat, 27.09.2026). The same in the build is wsa_systemapp.te;
; this file is for slots built without it (bin/transplant-a14.sh).
(type wsa_notification_service)
(roletype object_r wsa_notification_service)
(allow priv_app wsa_notification_service (service_manager (find)))
(allow system_app wsa_notification_service (service_manager (add)))
(typeattributeset service_manager_type (wsa_notification_service))
